'''''Star Wars: Legacy of the Force'' Round-Robin Interview''' was a group interview included in the back of the paperback version of ''[[Legacy of the Force: Inferno]]'', the sixth installment in the ''[[Star Wars: Legacy of the Force]]'' series. It is a [[Del Rey]]-moderated conversation between [[Aaron Allston]], [[Troy Denning]], and [[Karen Traviss]], the three authors who each wrote a trio of novels for the series. In the interview, the decision to kill [[Mara Jade Skywalker]] is discussed, along with favorite characters, the writing and research process, as well as how the authors interacted with one another. Unlike [[Star Wars: New Jedi Order Round-Robin Interview|the similar interview]] carried out regarding [[Star Wars: The New Jedi Order|The New Jedi Order]] series, the interview took place two thirds of the way through ''Legacy of the Force'', rather than once the arc had concluded.

